  "entries": [
    {
      "Original": "\nWhich guidelines do you want, and in what colours?",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "\n需要显示哪些辅助线？分别使用什么颜色？",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Action may be any of the following:",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "可用操作如下：",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "As above but only for the outer circle.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "同上，仅作用于外圈。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "As above but only for the target circle.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "同上，仅作用于目标圈。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Browse the github repo",
      "Context": ".ctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "浏览 GitHub 仓库",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Command Help",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader",
      "Translated": "命令帮助",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Enabled?",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "启用",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "For both: circles",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "两种圆圈：circles",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "For the outer circle: co, outer-circle, outer",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "外圈：co、outer-circle、outer",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "For the target circle: c, circle, target-circle",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "目标圈：c、circle、target-circle",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Guideline size modifier",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "引导线长度倍率",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Guidelines will always be drawn to at least this length, even if they would ordinarily have been smaller.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "引导线至少延伸到此长度，即使按目标大小本应更短。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Guidelines will never be longer than this, no matter how big the target's hitbox is.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "无论目标的判定范围有多大，引导线都不会超过此长度。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "How big should the outer circle be?\n\nValue is an offset to the target circle, and a value of 10 corresponds to 1 yalm.\nA value of 35 very closely resembles the max melee range.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "外圈要画多大？\n\n此值为相对于目标圈的偏移量，每 10 点对应 1 星码。\n设为 35 时接近近战攻击的最大距离。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "How wide/thick do you want the lines to be?",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "设置线条的粗细。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If enabled, the tether will be drawn entirely on the same plane as your target, even if your height is different. This is recommended if you intend to limit the tether length.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "启用后，即使你与目标高度不同，连线也会绘制在目标所在的平面上。若限制连线长度，建议开启。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Line colour for the tether",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.ColorEdit4",
      "Translated": "目标连线颜色",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Line thickness",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "线宽",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Maximum guideline size",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "引导线最长长度",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Minimum guideline size",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "引导线最短长度",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Most of the above toggle settings can be changed via command:",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "以上大部分开关均可通过命令更改：",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Open Positional Assistant's config window",
      "Context": "Plugin..ctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage",
      "Translated": "打开身位助手设置窗口",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Outer circle range",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "外圈范围",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Should a line be drawn connecting you to your target?",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "是否绘制连接自身与目标的线？",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Support me on ko-fi",
      "Context": ".ctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "在 Ko-fi 上支持作者",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Targets for circles are:",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "圆圈相关目标如下：",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Tether inner max length",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "连线内侧最大长度",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Tether line?",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "显示目标连线",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Tether outer max length",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderScalar",
      "Translated": "连线外侧最大长度",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The inner tether will never extend beyond the centre of the target's hitbox.\n\nSet to -1 to always go to the centre of the target's hitbox.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "内侧连线不会超过目标判定圈的中心。\n\n设为 -1 时始终延伸至目标中心。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The outer tether CAN extend beyond your hitbox.\n\nSet to -1 to always go to the centre of the your hitbox.\nSet to -2 to always go to the edge of your hitbox.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "外侧连线可以超出自身判定圈。\n\n设为 -1 时始终延伸至自身中心。\n设为 -2 时始终延伸至自身判定圈边缘。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The positional guidelines normally extend from the target's centre point out to the size of their hitbox. This allows you to make them longer or shorter.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "身位引导线默认从目标中心延伸到目标圈边缘。此处可调整引导线的长短。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "This plugin does not function in PvP.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "此插件在 PvP 中不生效。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "This setting will cause the circle colours to be always the defined ones and disable the automatic colouring of the circle based on the guidelines.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "固定圆圈颜色，始终使用指定颜色，不再根据引导线自动着色。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Two dimensional?",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "投影到目标所在平面",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Unknown action '",
      "Context": "Plugin.OnPluginCommand",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": "未知操作“",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Unknown target '",
      "Context": "Plugin.OnPluginCommand",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": "未知目标“",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Whether to draw any lines at all",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuitils.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "是否绘制引导线",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "You are currently in a PvP zone.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "当前位于 PvP 区域。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
